<https://w3id.org/laad/id/arc/catalogo/ficha/coc-90-10> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#describesOrDescribed> <https://w3id.org/laad/id/arc/catalogo/expediente/coc-90-10> <https://w3id.org/laad/grafo/catalogo> .
